<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>ri_Senke – Re_Quaderstruktur & Gedankenkommandos</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#06121c;--fg:#e6eef2;--panel:rgba(6,18,28,.84);--line:rgba(230,238,242,.22);--ro:#e0243a;--ra:#f4f4f4;--ri:#ffd93b;--re:#3ddc6a;box-sizing:border-box}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;overflow:hidden}
canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none}
.box{position:fixed;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.45;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);z-index:10}
#hud{top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 10px);left:12px;max-width:min(420px,calc(100vw - 24px))}
#hud b{font-size:15.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.3px}
#active-cmd{margin-top:6px;padding:6px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border-left:3px solid var(--ro);font-family:"Courier New",monospace;font-size:12.5px;word-break:break-word}
#active-desc{margin-top:4px;font-size:12px;opacity:.85;font-style:italic}

#ctrl{top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 10px);right:12px;width:min(340px,calc(100vw - 24px));display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.row{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center}
select,button{background:rgba(15,32,46,.9);color:var(--fg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:5px 8px;font-family:inherit;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer}
select{flex:1;min-width:0}
button:hover{background:rgba(30,60,84,.95);border-color:rgba(230,238,242,.45)}
button.active{background:rgba(61,220,106,.22);border-color:var(--re);color:#fff}
.tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:4px}
.tab{text-align:center;font-weight:600;padding:4px 0;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.04)}
.tab[data-op="Ro"].sel{background:rgba(224,36,58,.32);border-color:var(--ro)}
.tab[data-op="Ra"].sel{background:rgba(244,244,244,.25);border-color:var(--ra)}
.tab[data-op="Ri"].sel{background:rgba(255,217,59,.28);border-color:var(--ri)}
.tab[data-op="Re"].sel{background:rgba(61,220,106,.28);border-color:var(--re)}

#log-box{bottom:calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) + 48px);left:12px;width:min(420px,calc(100vw - 24px));max-height:130px;overflow-y:auto;font-size:12px}
#log-box h4{margin:0 0 4px 0;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;opacity:.75}
.log-item{padding:2px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);font-family:"Courier New",monospace;font-size:11.5px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}

#leg{bottom:calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) + 10px);left:12px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:12.5px}
#leg span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
#leg i{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--line)}

@media (max-width: 780px){
  #ctrl{top:auto;bottom:calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) + 52px);right:12px;width:calc(100vw - 24px)}
  #log-box{display:none}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Oben links: Status & aktives Gedankenkommando -->
<div class="box" id="hud">
  <b>ri_Senke – Gedankenkommandos</b><br>
  <span id="s">Re_Quaderstruktur sendet Vibrationen</span>
  <div id="active-cmd">Warte auf ersten Impuls...</div>
  <div id="active-desc">Zyklus: Ro → Ra → Ri → Re (400 Kommandos geladen)</div>
</div>

<!-- Oben rechts: Kommando-Steuerung (400 Befehle) -->
<div class="box" id="ctrl">
  <div class="row" style="justify-content:space-between">
    <strong style="font-size:12.5px">Kommando-Steuerung (400)</strong>
    <div class="row">
      <button id="btn-auto" class="active" title="Automatischer Zyklus">Auto: AN</button>
      <button id="btn-exec" title="Ausgewähltes Kommando jetzt senden">Ausführen</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tabs">
    <button class="tab sel" data-op="Ro">Ro (100)</button>
    <button class="tab" data-op="Ra">Ra (100)</button>
    <button class="tab" data-op="Ri">Ri (100)</button>
    <button class="tab" data-op="Re">Re (100)</button>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <select id="cmd-select"></select>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Unten links: Live-Protokoll & Farblegende -->
<div class="box" id="log-box">
  <h4>Ausgeführte Gedankenkommandos (<span id="exec-count">0</span>)</h4>
